    "chunk_text": "Nu synd twelf abusiua, \u00fe\u00e6t synd twelf un\u00feeawes \u00fee we eow secge\u00f0 on Leden & sy\u00f0\u00f0en on \u00e6nglisc. Duodecim abusiua sunt seculi, Hoc est, sapiens sine operibus bonis, senex sine religone, adolescens sine Nu gyf se wyte by\u00f0 buten gode weorcan se \u00fee o\u00f0re mannen scolde syllen gode bisne, hwu ne by\u00f0 sone Ne by\u00f0 se lare freomful, gyf se lar\u00f0eaw mid weorcan towurp\u00f0 his bodunge. Eft gyf se lar\u00f0eaw dwele\u00f0, hwa by\u00f0 his lar\u00f0eaw sy\u00f0\u00f0en? Gyf \u00fe\u00e6t eage ablinde\u00f0, ne by\u00f0 seo hand lochigende. Se ealde mann \u00fee by\u00f0 buten \u00e6wf\u00e6stnysse by\u00f0 \u00fean treowwe gelic, \u00fee leaf ber\u00f0 & blostmen, & n\u00e6nne Hw\u00e6t by\u00f0 \u00e6fre swa stuntlic, swa \u00fe\u00e6t se ealde nelle his mod to Gode gew\u00e6nden mid goden ingehyde, Junge mannen m\u00e6ig tweonigen hwe\u00f0er heo moten libben, & se ealde m\u00e6ig wyten gewiss him \u00feone \u00dean ealden is to warnigen wi\u00f0 \u00fea yfele ge\u00f0ohtes, for\u00fean \u00fee seo heorte ne ealde\u00f0, ne eac seo tunge, ac Wyte for \u00fey se ealde hw\u00e6t his elde gedafenige, & \u00fea \u00feing forseo \u00fee his sawle derige\u00f0. Se \u00feridde un\u00f0eaw is on \u00feyssen wurlde, \u00fe\u00e6t se junge mann beo buten gehersumnysse. Unwur\u00f0 by\u00f0 se on elde \u00fe\u00e6t him o\u00f0re m\u00e6nn \u00feenigen, se \u00fee on jugo\u00f0e nele his eldren gehersumigen. Ure H\u00e6lend on his jugo\u00f0e w\u00e6s gehyrsum his magen",
